# Kept out of the package that gets installed on the Homey. None of this is used at
# runtime, and the Homey has better uses for the storage. The App Store reads
# README*.txt; README.md and the other Markdown files are for GitHub only.
/README.md
/CONTRIBUTING.md
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
/package-lock.json
/tsconfig.json
/.eslintrc.json
/.homeyreview.md
